  "_comment": [
    "The upload register: what actually went out, and what did not.",
    "",
    "An entry is PUBLISHED only if it has a url. Everything else is pending,",
    "whether or not `blocked` explains why. A half-finished post is the",
    "dangerous case, because it feels done and is not.",
    "",
    "Keep this honest. It is the only durable record of a distribution run;",
    "session reminders die with the session."
